cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data it publishes, please cite it as below."
title: "veridem: a demographic data bank and change-monitoring pipeline for Türkiye"
abstract: >-
  Watches official demographic statistics for Türkiye and Europe (TurkStat
  SDMX, TurkStat press releases, Eurostat), detects substantive changes
  against its own stored history, and publishes what changed via an Atom
  feed and change reports.
authors:
  - family-names: Keskin
    given-names: Faruk
repository-code: "https://github.com/keskinfaruk/veridem"
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - demography
  - Türkiye
  - Turkey
  - official statistics
  - SDMX
  - TurkStat
  - Eurostat
  - open data
